rt!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] LoopBot online — calm, focused, and ready to help. What would you like to do today?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0faf84435cea46730169b7ea1f27948191b33d2f443d15f133\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1551,"output":62,"cacheRead":8064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9677,"cost":{"input":0.0038775000000000003,"output":0.00093,"cacheRead":0.002016,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0068235}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773660698047}}
{"type":"message","id":"c3705eb0","parentId":"5fdcec20","timestamp":"2026-03-16T11:34:58.763Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Mon 2026-03-16 11:34 UTC] Create a new skill, named \"pipeline_execution\", under \"/home/node/.openclaw/skills\", that call this endpoint \"http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/prototype_execution/prototype_execution/\", that essentially runs a ML pipeline, which details i'll tell you later.\nFirst of all, this skill needs an image file given by the user as input, that you have to upload using the same file uploading logic in the kidney_cancer_detection skill, through the same endpoint and with the same telegram user id logic. The input of the pipeline execution endpoint is the one attached in the .json file. When sending a request, use the obtained image path replacing the <image_path_here> placeholder in the given input .json file.\nI do not know which output structure to expect, so implement first this and based on the response we'll work on it later.\n\nEndpoint input JSON:\n\"{\n \"prototype_id\":\"69b7ce309fc31ca2c4714132\",\n \"created_at\":\"2026-03-16T09:32:32.788000\",\n \"updated_at\":\"2026-03-16T09:32:32.788000\",\n \"prototype_name\":\"Test_kidney_nexus\",\n \"prototype_description\":\"It Prototype\",\n \"prototype_subtitle\":null,\n \"prototype_players\":[\n {\n \"user_id\":\"626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be\",\n \"role\":\"owner\"\n }\n ],\n \"workflows\":[\n {\n \"workflow_name\":\"Test_kidney_nexus\",\n \"workflow_id\":\"wf_id\",\n \"workflow_type\":\"prototype\",\n \"branches\":[\n {\n \"branch_id\":\"mjia9vqwnj9v72se3hcx7\",\n \"branch_name\":\"Branch 1\",\n \"nodes\":[\n {\n \"node_category\":\"input\",\n \"node_sub_category\":\"Data Reader\",\n \"node_name\":\"NodeDataReader5\",\n \"node_label\":\"Image Reader\",\n \"node_description\":\"Reads one or more Images files\",