\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating script creation**\\n\\nI think I need to create a script, so I’ll check the existing files, possibly a template. I’m considering whether to include any resources, but I might be able to skip that part. It could be useful to read through some output patterns or workflows, yet I'm unsure if it’s truly necessary. I also need to inspect if there’s a kidney script available or any other relevant files I can find.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"I’m going to mirror the upload flow from the kidney skill, add a small runner script for the new endpoint, then package and commit the new skill.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0faf84435cea46730169b7eafb283c8191bb46072639425862\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_AezHc5VWb8PpleBVrmUOB83Q|fc_0faf84435cea46730169b7eafc4e1c8191942c7d641041d05c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/node/.openclaw/skills/pipeline-execution -maxdepth 2 -type f -print","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"find /home/node/.openclaw/skills/pipeline-execution -maxdepth 2 -type f -print\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_sdnwLhyGXjzMG5iZFMOrCHnm|fc_0faf84435cea46730169b7eafc4e2c8191acf6d118ee4b28ab","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-cancer-detector -maxdepth 3 -type f -print","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"find /home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-cancer-detector -maxdepth 3 -type f -print\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":921,"output":230,"cacheRead":22400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23551,"cost":{"input":0.0023025000000000003,"output":0.00345,"cacheRead":0.0056,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011352500000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse"